    "audited_paths": [],
    "reason": "The defect is the painted tooltip of the server-list search field: unescaped filter examples collide with formspec markup, so the hover text the menu draws is truncated or misparsed. The search still runs, so the shortfall exists only in the painted tip."
  },
  "fix_commit": "f03874c5252d9a181de2a5eabd31667a64c8d7cb",
  "issue": {
    "active_lock_reason": null,
    "assignee": null,
    "assignees": [],
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body_normalized": "### Luanti version\n\n```true\n5.16.0-dev\n```\n\n### Operating system and version\n\nGNU/Linux\n\n### Summary\n\nHover the server list search bar and the tooltip will say:\n\n> Possible filters\n> game:\\<name\\>\n> mod:\\<name\\>\n> player:\\<name\\>\n> sort:[-\n\nThe last line is the interesting one. I find that to be very cryptic tooltip and not useful.\n\n#### Analysis\n\nI saw this string in the source code:\n\n`sort:[-](name|relevance|players|mods|uptime|ping|lag)`\n\nThis string contains `[` and `]` which don't appear to be formspec-escaped. This is probably the reason.\n\n@cx384\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Hover the server list search bar",
    "body_raw": "### Luanti version\n\n```true\n5.16.0-dev\n```\n\n### Operating system and version\n\nGNU/Linux\n\n### Summary\n\nHover the server list search bar and the tooltip will say:\n\n> Possible filters\n> game:\\<name\\>\n> mod:\\<name\\>\n> player:\\<name\\>\n> sort:[-\n\nThe last line is the interesting one. I find that to be very cryptic tooltip and not useful.\n\n#### Analysis\n\nI saw this string in the source code:\n\n`sort:[-](name|relevance|players|mods|uptime|ping|lag)`\n\nThis string contains `[` and `]` which don't appear to be formspec-escaped. This is probably the reason.\n\n@cx384 \n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Hover the server list search bar",
    "body_sha256": "23436101d6cab0f154f00220df785b1bd970b385af114dc529418514844edf86",
